max.description:
Maximum number of themes to return. Use 3-5 to surface only the closest matches;
larger to browse adjacent themes.
Pass as a JSON number, unquoted — e.g. 5.

period.description:
Time period for which trades should be retrieved.
Defaults to TODAY if not specified. All boundaries are calculated in UTC.
TODAY — current calendar day (UTC);
DAYS_7/DAYS_30/DAYS_60/DAYS_90 — rolling N-day window ending today (UTC);
MONTH_TO_DATE — first day of the current month through today (UTC);
YEAR_TO_DATE — first day of the current year through today (UTC);
LAST_QUARTER/TWO_QUARTERS_AGO/THREE_QUARTERS_AGO/FOUR_QUARTERS_AGO — individual completed calendar quarters, most recent first.
Case-sensitive: use the uppercase value exactly as listed.
